          "description": "Only with --query, and only when the query read snapshots: the data of the PR's snapshot the query was decided on (null when the snapshot failed or never loaded; the PR is then in snapshot_failures). ready and attention are the values of the ready and attention query fields. A field the snapshot did not report is null.",
          "properties": {
            "ci_state": {
              "type": [
                "string",
                "null"
